        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "danielle.smith@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "danielle.smith@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Aug 14 2020 16:26:33 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>Stryker Chairman and CEO, Kevin Lobo, recently joined The Constellation Forum, an annual summit hosted by Northwell Health, which gathers industry leaders to share insights and strategies around healthcare innovation.</p>\n<p>In a one-on-one conversation with Stanley Bergman, chairman and CEO of Henry Schein, Kevin discusses how to deal with disruption amid the coronavirus pandemic by supporting employees and customers, our company’s diversity and inclusion progress and the overall importance of corporate responsibility.<br>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hz7VdgGiWpU\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">CONTINUE TO WATCH VIDEO</span></a></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Aug 14 2020 17:14:04 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    }
